 false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "21674623", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001413769", "personaname": "Classicsniper00", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/classicsniper00/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 230, "playtime_forever": 424, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 424, "last_played": 1457321157, "avatar": "d35f0c0c1fa5c81fc70c2c2721a7c655a812c2fa"}, "language": "english", "review": "I simply got this game so I could finally understand all these f*cking memes.", "timestamp_created": 1457300288, "timestamp_updated": 1457300288, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496208369731903076", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "21663957", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003176007", "personaname": "cybx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cybx/", "num_games_owned": 204, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 2197, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1770, "last_played": 1726366145, "avatar": "a531983096d0ebbc65ffb95bf7a5e9dddce987a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "excellent", "timestamp_created": 1457267043, "timestamp_updated": 1457267043, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474477618932723999", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "21627992", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970939744", "personaname": "AV8R", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AVEightR/", "num_games_owned": 626, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 7904, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7816, "last_played": 1538345416, "avatar": "b3c041f3eb316e0edf16e6ba36f426b433e16cee"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is simply one of the most fun action titles I've ever played. It has really great gameplay that made me feel like a tanky space marine. The class-based multiplayer is pretty well-balanced, and the horde mode is challenging, and great for playing with friends.\n\nPros:\nReally cool weapons.\nPlays well with a gamepad or kb/m.\nReally smooth gameplay jumping between ranged and melee.\nPretty good plot that fits well in WH40K universe.\nGood flavor in fighting orks vs. chaos - orks have overwhelming numbers, chaos have beefy units to rival your own strength.\nJump pack scenes work well.\n\nCons:\nLack of split-screen local co-op\nIt's a console port, and this shows up in the menu design, graphics options, and obnoxious checkpoint save system.\nNo moddability\nAt this point they should remove the grind for unlocking stuff in MP mode, at least if you just want to go play co-op.\nThe entire game, including a really tough mid-game boss, has consistent mechanics and skill use, then the final boss is just a game of simon says. That could've been better.\nSometimes platforms/wall clipping doesn't quite match the visual", "timestamp_created": 1457126842, "timestamp_updated": 1457126842, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525522351264953613", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}